From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 12:57:36 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 18/18] Release 0.3.0

Replace packages/ with the 0.3.0 crate, sdist and the wheel built from
the extracted sdist, and move the 0.2.0 patch series into
patches/0.2.0/. Add the installed-package release evidence: installed.py
and release_checks.py (lean, full and matrix parity, tutorial and user
manual blocks), the campaign manifest replay, the SciPy search, the
cargo package and Python build logs, and a summary of the installed
checks. Add the 0.3.0 performance log with the ten rounds, the rejected
attempt, the cumulative native table, the installed Python optimization
table, release checks and reproduction steps.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
